  m_Text: "1: Double check that the white box is plugged into a wall outlet with
    power\n2: Be sure that both USB plugs are connected\n3: Close other SMMARTS programs
    left running in the background (use Alt+Tab) \n\n\nIf this message keeps appearing:\n-
    Disconnect everything including power and USB plugs \n- Shut down\n- Then reconnect
    everything and restart."
